equipment fit for anyone under level 5; the donation room (5n, e) has
castoffs from generous veterans. Wear and wield everything, then
practice on the newbie farm.

Death carries NO penalty at level 5 and under, so this is the time to
take risks and learn |YKBkill|YKO, |YKBassess|YKO, and |YKBwimpy|YKO. Ask
questions freely on the newbie channel -- everyone started here.

Choose your corpse automation: |YKBset autogold on|YKO takes coins only,
while |YKBset autoloot on|YKO takes coins and every gettable item, making
autogold redundant and filling your inventory faster.

|YKBset autokill on|YKO does not attack by itself; it only makes a manually
entered bare |YKBkill|YKO choose the first visible NPC. Keep naming targets
until you are comfortable. |YKBset wimpy 25|YKO retreats below 25 percent
HP when an escape is possible. |YKBset combatbrief-short on|YKO trims combat
text; in busy groups, |YKBset combatbrief-self on|YKO keeps attacks by or on
you, and |YKBset combatbrief-hit on|YKO hides misses and dodges.|XX0

